  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed advertisement, by reason of its scale, appearance and location would result in an obstructive and intrusive form of development that would create distractions for highway users reducing the safety of the highway. As such the proposed development is contrary to policy D8 &#x27;Public Realm&#x27; of the London Plan (2021) as well as policy PP1 &#x27;Public Realm&#x27;, LP7 &#x27;Advertisements&#x27; and LP42 &#x27;Walking and Cycling&#x27; of the Hackney Local Plan and Policy BN.16: Designing advertisements of the LLDC Local Plan (2020).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The proposed advertisement, by reason of its scale, siting and appearance would result in an obtrusive and visually incongruous feature that contributes to an unsightly proliferation and clutter of signage and street furniture in the local area that would detract from the visual amenity of the street scene. As such, the proposal would be contrary to policies D4 (Delivering Good Design),&amp;nbsp; D8 (Public Realm) of the London Plan (2021) and policies PP1 (Public Realm), LP1 (High Quality Design) and LP7 (Advertisements) of Hackney&#x27;s Local Development Plan (2020) and Policy BN.16: Designing advertisements of the LLDC Local Plan (2020)&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
